      "t": "Alone in the corridor, Chef Barinov calls Elena Pavlovna in a disguised voice, pretending to be a daring scuba diver and secret admirer rather than a chef. When Max walks in at the worst possible moment, Barinov snaps and chases him away to finish his phone call.",
